# README

## Installation Steps

Download the project files

Make sure Python 3.6 or later is installed on your system. You can download it from [python.org](https://www.python.org/downloads/).

Run below to install all dependencies required

### Setting up the virutal environment
In a bash terminal :

```bash
python -m venv venv 
```

- Linux/Mac/Windows(bash/powershell)
    ```bash
    source venv/Sripts/activate
    ```
- Windows(cmd prompt)
    ```bash
    venv/Scripts/activate
    ```

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```
To deactivate the virtual environment run
```bash
deactivate
```


## Running the Application

Open a terminal

Navigate to the project's root directory

Run the application

```bash
python app.py
```

Once the application is running, you can access it by this link
```
http://127.0.0.1:5000/
```
